    "answer": {
      "short": "32.5% discount.",
      "worked": "Let the original cost be $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Final price}&=x\\times0.75\\times0.9\\\\\\text{Final price}&=0.675x\\\\\\text{Overall discount}&=100\\%-67.5\\%\\\\\\text{Overall discount}&=32.5\\%\\end{align*}$$\nThe final price is 67.5% of the original, so Kate received a 32.5% discount.",
